{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What starts as a routine cave mapping expedition becomes something else entirely.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep beneath the surface\u2014where light fades and echoes linger\u2014you\u2019ll follow the trail of missing explorers who left behind little more than footprints and scattered gear. But their disappearance is only the beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Cavernreach</i></strong> is a story-driven, first-person exploration game set in a massive, handcrafted cave system. Designed for fans of atmospheric adventures and slow-burn mysteries, it invites you to descend into darkness and piece together a truth buried far below the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll rappel into caverns, dive through flooded tunnels, and navigate narrow crawlspaces\u2014all while managing your equipment and fending off the creeping sense that something is watching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no combat\u2014only isolation, dwindling supplies, and a growing awareness that you're not alone in the dark.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features </strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rich narrative experience inspired by real-world caving and deep-Earth conspiracy theories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Naturalistic environmental storytelling with a focus on immersion and atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light gear/resource management (batteries, oxygen, glowsticks, etc.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Subtle mysteries and secrets for players who dig beneath the surface</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice-acted radio dialogue and ambient sound design</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3715410?t=1773800160","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3715410?t=1773800160","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.